- T+0min: Attacker sends property traversal payload
- T+5sec: JSP webshell written to webapps/ROOT/shell.jsp
- T+10sec: Webshell executes first command (whoami)
- T+30sec: Malware download initiated
- T+2min: Mirai botnet binary executed, joins DDoS pool
- T+5min: Server begins sending DDoS traffic to targets
- T+72h: Botnet operator collects $20K-50K in DDoS service revenue

